,"pointer":21846,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一一六","author":"曹于汴","text":"不慑于巨祸，不怵于殊荣。\n不眩于久昵，白首鲜能行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21847,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一一七","author":"曹于汴","text":"饮毒十年前，毒发十年后。\n智人慎举匕，懵人悼成疚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21848,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一一八","author":"曹于汴","text":"日照不择地，雨润无遗草。\n吾心藏仁机，嫉恶亦能槁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21849,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一一九","author":"曹于汴","text":"饱食卧北窗，多少恩难补。\n征人捍边陲，农夫劳畎亩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21850,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一二○","author":"曹于汴","text":"利荣无冀想，推挽绝偏私。\n杳杳高风在，执鞭我愿之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21851,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一二一","author":"曹于汴","text":"请看鼓楫人，江海如平地。\n由来此世途，各自分难易。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21852,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一二二","author":"曹于汴","text":"莫视圣者高，自高更局促。\n暑葛寒以绵，人人赞化育。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21853,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一二三","author":"曹于汴","text":"天心最憎机，人心能照机。\n试观海上客，何事不忘机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21854,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一二四","author":"曹于汴","text":"积风风乃厚，强信终成疑。\n相逢才半面，便道遇钟期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21855,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一二五","author":"曹于汴","text":"乡愿万寻坑，白头跳不出。\n图个世人称，年年囚鬼窟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21856,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一二六","author":"曹于汴","text":"点检从前事，感应如桴鼓。\n勿云方寸幽，天公于此睹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21857,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一二七","author":"曹于汴","text":"常凭未发天，好令直如弦。\n忽忽初念转，照照却惺然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21858,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬诗 其一二八","author":"曹于汴","text":"朝暮相煎急，谁人会个休。\n通来一寸血，点点逐浮沤。","collection":"明","notice":""