":"曹于汴","text":"郑重多贤辅圣君，不才自合老烟云。\n儿童课罢书堂寂，种竹栽花日又曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21884,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻报书怀四首 其三","author":"曹于汴","text":"利锁名缰久若遗，无端犹尔浪猜疑。\n而今想在相抛却，正是茅檐稳睡时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21885,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻报书怀四首 其四","author":"曹于汴","text":"尘世繁劳不上肩，山中长夏日如年。\n千秋未了遗编在，且喜蝇头也会看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21886,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初任司理到任日吏用印报云升授吏科给事中虚套取喜何必乃尔走笔题其上","author":"曹于汴","text":"休饰虚章报吏科，纵成真取便如何。\n眼前羞作瞒心事，莫把津华觊望多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21887,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梁燕重来二首 其一","author":"曹于汴","text":"万里都门春复春，雕梁燕垒又更新。\n呢喃相向如相讶，不是燕人是晋人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21888,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梁燕重来二首 其二","author":"曹于汴","text":"年年作客客华堂，归燕殷勤话暖凉。\n飞过回廊还对语，主人何事鬓成霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":21889,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藤","author":"曹于汴","text":"嫩枝柔干倩相扶，未信终成矮地铺。\n当